38. +=
============================================================

Instead of:

    x = x + 5;


write:

    x += 5;


Example:

    int x = 10;

    x += 5;


Result:

    15


============================================================
39. -=
============================================================

    x -= 5;


means:

    x = x - 5;


Example:

    int x = 20;

    x -= 8;


Result:

    12


============================================================
40. *=
============================================================

    x *= 3;


means:

    x = x * 3;


Example:

    int x = 5;

