41. /=
============================================================

    x /= 2;


means:

    x = x / 2;


Example:

    int x = 20;

    x /= 4;


Result:

    5


============================================================
42. %=
============================================================

    x %= 3;


means:

    x = x % 3;


Example:

    int x = 10;

