============================================================

1. Use parentheses when logic could be misunderstood.

2. Avoid overly complicated expressions.

3. Do not mix assignment and comparison carelessly.

4. Avoid modifying the same variable multiple times in one
   complicated expression.

5. Use logical operators for logical conditions.

6. Use bitwise operators for bit manipulation.

